<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Deelkraal Sept qtr pre-capex net tumbles.</title>
<headline>Deelkraal Sept qtr pre-capex net tumbles.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Sept versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit before capital spending	   2.94  vs   11.53</p>
<p>    Capital spending				   11.67 vs   13.02</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled				    309,000 vs 313,000</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)				 1,718.4 vs 1,844.0</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)					 5.6 vs 5.9</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)				    52,724 vs 46,072</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)				 55,030 vs 53,096</p>
<p>Full name: Deelkraal Gold Mining Co Ltd, managed by Gold Fields of South Africa Ltd.</p>
<p>NOTE - Gold output is expected to increase in the forthcoming quarter.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
